{
 "version": 1,
 "doc": [
 "Shared contract vectors for what the dashboard (and any other consumer of the feed) reads from a node: the replication",
 "records of /v1/sync, the roster of /v1/roster, /v1/health, message expiry and the vocabulary of priorities, kinds and",
 "ack vias. The node (internal/msg, internal/store) and the dashboard read this same file; retraction has its own,",
 "retract-vectors.json. A reader that does not know a top-level key must ignore it.",
 "records: 'record' is one /v1/sync element. 'valid' is what a node's replication check (msg.Record.ValidateReplicated)",
 "says, 'reason' a word of why not. A record that is not valid is served as an ack 'quarantined' by 'aivoicebus/quarantine'.",
 "'canonical' says decoding then encoding gives the same JSON back (no field renamed or dropped).",
 "expiry: 'msg' and 'now' give 'expired' and 'expires_at' (empty = never expires), evaluated by the reader.",
 "roster: msg.MergeRosters over 'lists' gives 'expect'. health: the fields of 'json' that 'expect' names, decoded.",
 "acks: how a reader classifies an ack id (receipt, retraction, or a claimed retraction that is not valid).",
 "To change anything here is a protocol change: tell the dashboard's maintainers before the node release."
 ],
 "vocabulary": {
 "priorities": [
  "fyi",
  "ask",
  "urgent"
 ],
 "default_priority": "ask",
 "kinds": [
  "question",
  "answer",
  "task",
  "claim",
  "end",
  "lease", "progress"],
 "ack_via": [
  "hook",
  "hook-count",
  "inbox",
  "cli"
 ],
 "quarantine": {
  "id": "quarantined",
  "by": "aivoicebus/quarantine"
 }
 },
